nodes.body:
@hnyls2002 Could you take a look at this focused fix for #41539, or help route it to the appropriate reviewer? It prevents a worker whose launcher died during startup from sending SIGQUIT to PID 1, while preserving normal launcher notification.

The PR records five parent-process regression tests, six existing watchdog tests, and isolated Linux lifecycle reproduction. The parent-selection fix was split out from #40596 following its author's suggestion. Full GPU serving validation has not been run.

The branch still needs updating for the current minimum-base requirement in #21065, and `run-ci` is missing. Could you review the approach and help authorize the relevant CI once the branch is updated? Thanks!

